வாலுவன்","lemma":"வாலுவன்","gloss":"cook/priest"}],"gloss":"cook"},{"surface":"ஏந்த","parts":[{"text":"ஏந்து","lemma":"ஏந்து","gloss":"hold up"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to hold up"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வதுவை","parts":[{"text":"வதுவை","lemma":"வதுவை","gloss":"wedding/marriage"}],"gloss":"wedding"},{"surface":"விழவின்","parts":[{"text":"விழவு","lemma":"விழவு","gloss":"festival"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"like/of"}],"gloss":"like a festival"},{"surface":"புதுவோர்க்கு","parts":[{"text":"புதுவோர்","lemma":"புதுவோர்","gloss":"newcomers/guests"},{"text":"க்கு","lemma":"க்கு","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to the newcomers"},{"surface":"எல்லாம்","parts":[{"text":"எல்லாம்","lemma":"எல்லாம்","gloss":"all"}],"gloss":"all"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வெவ்வாய்","parts":[{"text":"வெவ்வாய்","lemma":"வெவ்வாய்","gloss":"cruel mouths"}],"gloss":"cruel mouths","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெய்த","parts":[{"text":"பெய்","lemma":"பெய்","gloss":"pour/place"},{"text":"த","lemma":"த்து","gloss":"past tense marker"}],"gloss":"poured"},{"surface":"பூதநீர்","parts":[{"text":"பூதம்","lemma":"பூதம்","gloss":"demon/spirit"},{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"நீர்","gloss":"water"}],"gloss":"water for the demons"},{"surface":"சால்க","parts":[{"text":"சால்","lemma":"சால்","gloss":"be abundant/suffice"},{"text":"க","lemma":"க","gloss":"optative suffix"}],"gloss":"may it be abundant"},{"surface":"என","parts":[{"text":"என","lemma":"என","gloss":"saying/thus"}],"gloss":"saying"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புலவுக்களம்","parts":[{"text":"புலவு","lemma":"புலவு","gloss":"flesh/reek"},{"text":"களம்","lemma":"களம்","gloss":"field"}],"gloss":"battlefield reeking of flesh"},{"surface":"பொலிய","parts":[{"text":"பொலி","lemma":"பொலி","gloss":"shine/flourish"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to shine"},{"surface":"வேட்டோய்","parts":[{"text":"வேட்டோய்","lemma":"வேட்டோய்","gloss":"you who performed the sacrifice"}],"gloss":"you who performed the sacrifice","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நின்","parts":[{"text":"நின்","lemma":"நின்","gloss":"your"}],"gloss":"your"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நிலவுத்திகழ்","parts":[{"text":"நிலவு","lemma":"நிலவு","gloss":"moonlight"},{"text":"திகழ்","lemma":"திகழ்","gloss":"shining"}],"gloss":"moonlight-shining"},{"surface":"ஆரம்","parts":[{"text":"ஆரம்","lemma":"ஆரம்","gloss":"pearl necklace/garland"}],"gloss":"pearl necklace"},{"surface":"முகக்குவம்","parts":[{"text":"முக","lemma":"முக","gloss":"scoop/draw"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"future/formative"},{"text":"வம்","lemma":"வம்","gloss":"we"}],"gloss":"we will scoop up"},{"surface":"எனவே","parts":[{"text":"என","lemma":"என","gloss":"saying"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"therefore"}]}],"literal":"Beating the tightly bound tari drum to make a vibrating sound, / praising all that came and gathered, / with the shining sword's glowing light flashing to bring victory / in the dense military camp that showered a rain of arrows, / with the severed heads of hostile enemies as hearths, / with the wood-apple wood as firewood, the swaying cooking smoke lines rising, / with the unending skulls as bowls, and Vanni wood as ladles, / the demoness who has not given birth scooping and stirring and cooking, / while the cook holds up the food offering of sacrificial animal meat, / like a wedding festival, to all the newcomers, / saying 'May the water poured into the cruel mouths of the demons be abundant!' / you performed the sacrifice so that the battlefield reeking of flesh would shine, O King! / Therefore, we will scoop up your moonlight-shining pearl necklace!","translation":"Beating the tightly bound tari drum with a deep, vibrating sound, we praised all who gathered. In the dense military camp where a rain of arrows showered, your shining sword flashed with a victorious glow. There, you performed a terrible sacrifice on the battlefield reeking of flesh: using the severed heads of your unyielding enemies as hearth-stones, wood-apple branches as firewood from which smoke curled, skulls as cooking vessels, and ladles of Vanni wood, a barren demoness scooped, stirred, and cooked the flesh of the slain. As the cook held up the sacrificial offering, you served it to all the newcomers as if at a wedding feast, saying, 'May this water poured into the cruel mouths of the demons be abundant!' O King who made the battlefield shine with this sacrifice, we have come to receive your moonlight-bright pearl necklaces in abundance!","modern":"இறுக்கமாகக் கட்டப்பட்ட தடாரிப் பறையை 'விம்' என்று ஒலிக்குமாறு அடித்து, உன்னைப் புகழ்ந்து பாடி வந்தவர்களெல்லாம் ஒன்றுதிரண்டனர். அம்புகள் மழையாகப் பொழிந்த நெருக்கமான பாசறையில், உன்னுடைய ஒளிரும் வாள் வெற்றியைத் தரும் ஒளியோடு மின்னியது. அங்கே, பகைவர்களின் வெட்டப்பட்ட தலைகளை அடுப்புக் கற்களாகவும், விளா மரக் குச்சிகளை விறகாகவும் கொண்டு, புகை வளைந்து எழ, மண்டையோடுகளைப் பாத்திரங்களாகவும், வன்னி மரக் குச்சிகளைத் துடுப்புகளாகவும் பயன்படுத்தி, பிள்ளை பெறாத பேய்மகள் துழாவிச் சமைத்தாள். சமையல்காரன் அந்தப் பலி உணவை ஏந்தி நிற்க, திருமண விழாப் பந்தலில் புதிய விருந்தினர்களுக்குப் பரிமாறுவது போல, 'பேய்களின் கொடிய வாய்களில் ஊற்றப்படும் பலிநீர் நிறைவாக இருக்கட்டும்!' என்று கூறி, புலால் நாற்றம் வீசும் போர்க்களமே சிறந்து விளங்குமாறு வேள்வி செய்தாய். அத்தகைய வேள்வியைச் செய்த மன்னனே! உன்னுடைய நிலவு போன்ற முத்து மாலையைப் பெற்றுக் கொள்வதற்காக நாங்கள் வந்துள்ளோம்.","explanation":"The poet Māṅkuṭi Kiḻār praises the Pāṇṭiyaṉ king Neṭuñceḻiyaṉ, who won the battle of Talaiyālaṅkāṉam. The poem describes the 'Maṟakkaḷa Vēḷvi' (the sacrifice on the battlefield of warriors), a gruesome ritual where the victorious king offers the flesh of slain enemies to battlefield demons. The poet uses vivid, macabre imagery: severed heads of enemies serve as hearth-stones, skulls as cooking pots, and Vanni wood as ladles. A barren demoness (ēṉā vēṇmāḷ) stirs the gruesome brew of flesh. The feast is compared ironically to a joyous wedding festival (vatuvai viḦavu) where guests are served generously. This belongs to the Vākai tiṇai (victory), celebrating the king's absolute dominance over his foes.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.78],[0.78,1.1],[1.15,1.18],[1.2,1.9],[1.9,2.3],[2.3,2.6],[2.6,2.9],[2.9,3.0],[3.0,4.4],[4.4,5.03],[5.19,5.5],[5.56,5.74],[5.74,7.0],[7.0,7.3],[7.3,7.7],[7.7,8.0],[8.33,9.0],[9.0,10.0],[10.0,10.6],[10.6,10.8],[10.8,12.1],[12.1,12.1],[12.1,12.83],[12.83,13.3],[13.3,14.0],[14.0,14.4],[14.4,14.8],[14.8,15.2],[15.43,15.65],[15.65,16.11],[16.33,16.9],[16.9,17.3],[18.08,18.68],[18.68,19.08],[19.08,19.48],[19.63,19.98],[20.08,20.28],[20.28,20.64],[20.7,20.88],[20.88,21.58],[21.69,22.65],[22.65,22.65],[22.65,22.65],[22.65,22.81],[22.98,24.21],[24.21,25.15],[25.15,25.38],[25.38,25.88],[25.98,26.53],[26.53,26.8],[26.8,26.8],[26.8,28.18],[28.18,28.68]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.2],[1.2,1.9],[1.96,2.2],[2.2,3.0],[3.0,3.3],[3.3,3.5],[3.5,3.7],[3.7,5.37],[5.9,5.93],[5.93,5.97],[5.98,6.8],[6.8,6.8],[6.8,6.8],[6.8,9.1],[9.1,9.1],[9.1,11.03],[11.03,11.68],[11.68,12.0],[12.0,12.5],[12.5,13.6],[13.6,13.6],[13.6,14.2],[14.2,14.2],[14.2,15.4],[15.4,15.96],[16.07,16.3],[16.3,16.7],[16.7,17.7],[17.7,17.9],[17.9,19.1],[19.1,19.34],[20.16,20.96],[20.96,21.26],[21.26,21.78],[21.78,22.16],[22.16,23.06],[23.06,23.39],[23.39,24.16],[24.16,24.56],[24.56,24.99],[25.31,25.53],[25.53,25.85],[25.85,25.96],[25.96,27.37],[27.59,28.25],[28.25,28.25],[28.25,28.25],[28.25,28.25],[28.25,28.36],[28.36,28.81],[29.71,31.96],[31.96,32.26]]}}